MODULE: VERIFIED_AFOQT_SCOPE

OBJECTIVE:
Lock MINERVA curriculum to verified AFOQT quantitative scope.

SOURCE_OF_TRUTH:
Current public AFOQT outline from Pearson VUE is treated as active test-outline source.

